WEBVTT

00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:30.044
When I was on this stage in 2015,

00:01:30.086 --> 00:01:33.005
I was one of many people who said

00:01:33.005 --> 00:01:35.883
we weren't ready
and we needed to get ready.

00:01:36.676 --> 00:01:37.927
We didn't.

00:01:38.845 --> 00:01:42.056
The speech actually was watched
by a lot of people.

00:01:42.431 --> 00:01:47.270
But 90 percent of the views
were after it was too late.

00:01:47.311 --> 00:01:49.772
(Laughter)

00:01:50.231 --> 00:01:53.901
So now I hope the need is clear.

00:01:54.652 --> 00:01:56.529
And of course, we've learned a lot.

00:01:56.529 --> 00:01:58.447
During this pandemic,

00:01:58.489 --> 00:02:02.994
a lot of things worked well,
a lot of things didn't work well.